{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔……看到讨厌的人了。”", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "rk0620", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔呼呼。好久不见了呢，兰华小姐……不对，濑名学园长。”", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "结子", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": "yk0138", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这么久没见，一来就是讽刺？”", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "rk0621", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你想太多了，哪里是讽刺。”", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "结子", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": "yk0139", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……像以前一样叫兰华就好了。至少我现在也是把你当朋友的。”", "text_idx": 181, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "rk0622", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哎呀，是那样吗？我还以为自己一定被兰华小姐讨厌了呢……”", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "结子", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": "yk0140", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这个嘛～我倒是被结子的女儿讨厌了吧。”", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "rk0623", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“美羽？怎么会……”", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "结子", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": "yk0141", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你什么都没听说吗？我让她遇到很多难过的事……”", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "rk0624", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为美羽是个不会对我吐苦水的孩子……”", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "结子", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": "yk0142", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“跟我女儿很像呢，那种个性。”", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "rk0625", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“小爱理过得好吗？”", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "结子", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": "yk0143", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“她离家出走了。”", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "rk0626", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哎呀哎呀……”", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "结子", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": "yk0144", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“孩子都渐渐长大了呢。”", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "rk0627", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就是说啊……”", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "结子", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": "yk0145", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那你呢？最近怎么样，过得好吗？”", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "rk0628", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，托福。”", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "结子", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": "yk0146", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这样啊。不要再像以前那样逞强了喔。虽然不想说出口，但我们都不年轻了。”", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "rk0629", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“兰华小姐才是，要说年轻时的乱来的话……”", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "结子", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": "yk0147", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“还说呢，结子你不是也相当夸张吗？”", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "rk0630", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔呼呼，现在想起来都变成美好回忆了。”", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "结子", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": "yk0148", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……就是说啊。”", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "rk0631", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "结子", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": "yk0149", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不过，孩子总是和父母很像呢～美羽跟结子年轻时一模一样。”", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "rk0632", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是那样吗？”", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "结子", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": "yk0150", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没错。傻得那么正直、坦率，而且……”", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "rk0633", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“有一双澄澈到让人忌妒的眼睛。”", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "rk0634", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“兰华小姐也是那样喔。”", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "结子", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": "yk0151", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不要这样说啦～我才不是那种类型。”", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "rk0635", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……但我还是忘不了喔。那些跟兰华小姐一起为了保护森林而奔走的日子。”", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "结子", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": "yk0152", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我只是被你拖下水而已。”", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "rk0636", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我很感谢你，兰华小姐……”", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "结子", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": "yk0153", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……那样的我，现在却是站在‘这一边’了呢。”", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "rk0637", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真的不知道该说是讽刺还是……”", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "rk0638", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“兰华小姐这么努力不是吗？为了美羽和爱理她们……”", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "结子", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": "yk0154", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“即使如此，我还是希望自己是跟你站在同一边的人。”", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "rk0639", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "结子", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": "yk0155", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呀～呐～气氛都变阴沉了。结子，下次来办一个只有我们两个人的同学会吧？我下个月有很多空档时间。”", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 48, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "rk0640", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“说的也是呢。孩子们差不多也到了不再需要担心的年纪了……”", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "结子", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": "yk0156", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……女儿都是这样，有了男人之后心都往那边去了。”", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "rk0641", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是从旁看着她们也是身为母亲的幸福喔。”", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "结子", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": "yk0157", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那是真心话？”", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "rk0642", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "结子", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": "yk0158", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“还是一样这么狡猾的笑容呢。”", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "rk0643", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为孩子总有一天会离开父母……”", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "结子", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": "yk0159", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……嗯，也是啦。”", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "rk0644", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“今后女儿们也请你多照顾了。”", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "结子", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": "yk0160", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我知道啦。所以我才会到‘这一边’来啊。”", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "rk0645", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "结子", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": "yk0161", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是，那些孩子们会注意到吗……”", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "rk0646", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这个嘛，还不知道呢。”", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "结子", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": "yk0162", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你不告诉她吗？”", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "rk0647", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……或许没有那个必要。”", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "结子", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": "yk0163", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嘿～这么信任啊。”", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "rk0648", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为女儿好像找到了。”", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "结子", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": "yk0164", "char_id": "結子"}]}
